<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">皆さんのおかげで楽しくお正月を迎えられる</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">人がいーーーーっぱいいます！私もその</span><span class=\"s2\">1</span><span class=\"s1\">人です！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">細やかながら応援しています</span><span class=\"s3\">📣</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">少し落ち着いたらゆっくり休んでね〜</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text